    <source>Pitches read from the vocal score by Karl Klindworth (Mainz: B. Schott's Söhne; Internet Archive diewalkrevollstn00wagn), pp. 188–189; assignment of lines to instrument groups inferred from the full score (Mainz: B. Schott's Söhne; Internet Archive diewalkre00wagn_0), pp. 619–624, which was also used to correct bars 1–8 and 13–15. Not a full-score transcription.</source>
